3. The Company operates primarily in the business of manufacturing of Linkage Parts and Components for Off-Highway Vehicles. Chief Operating Decision Maker (CODM) evaluates the company's performance, based on the analysis of the various performance indicators of the company. The Chief Operating Decision Maker (CODM) has decided that there is no reportable segment for the Company.								 &lt;br /&gt; 
